I walk out of the sports hall.
It is already dark outside.
The wind is very cold tonight.
I zip up my jacket.
I walk over to the bus stop.
I stand and wait for the bus.
My legs are very tired now.
I ran very fast inside on the court.
But it is a really good feeling.
My arms are tired after the game.
I love to be active after work.
I sit very still at the office all day.
I am already thinking about the next game.
I look at my phone.
The bus arrives in eight minutes.
I am looking forward to sitting down.
It was lovely to meet Kasper and Sara.
I would like to play with them again.
I am going to play badminton again next week.
